<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><img alt="QantasLetterheadUpdated" src="" style="max-width: 714.7100952148437px" title="QantasLetterheadUpdated" /><br />
<br />
Hello {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},<br />
<br />
<b>File Reference -&nbsp;</b>{{{Case.Baggage_File_Reference__c}}}<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Thanks again for your patience while we assessed your damaged bag. We have determined your baggage is unsuitable for repair, and would like to provide a replacement.&nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Qantas has partnered with Delsey, a Paris-based baggage supplier, which is used by airline crew around the world. All bags have a five-year warranty, are tamper-proof and equipped with TSA locks. Please see&nbsp;<a href="https://qantas.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/#900000010OOK/a/Mo000004QvLJ/hQcMuMns_nU7baEd.kwHefGvQD29FqlKy.hmbH7wB9o">Qantas Delsey Brochure</a><strong>&nbsp;</strong>for you to choose and advise us of a bag similar to the bag being replaced (eg. type, colour, size). Where the colour selected is unavailable, we will replace with an Anthracite coloured bag.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
So that we can arrange delivery of your new baggage, please complete the attached <a href="https://qantas.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/#900000010OOK/a/Mo000004QvbR/YqEUKZjJEB9NsZk_5c7DeTPrMnh0BDZqt3jIB06zeMg"><span style="color:#2980b9;">Replacement Baggage Release Form</span></a> and return to us by replying to this email. When providing your preferred delivery address and phone number, please be aware that baggage is only delivered during business hours.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Once again, on behalf of the VIP team at Qantas, we apologise for the inconvenience experienced. We are confident that you will be delighted with your new baggage and thank you again for your understanding.<br />
<br />
Kind Regards,<br />
&nbsp;<br />
{{{Sender.FirstName}}}<br />
Qantas VIP Service Team&nbsp;<br />
Within Australia 1300 752 801<br />
World Wide &nbsp;+61 2 6122 1111</body>
